@startuml components
title Componentes lógicos y dependencias
component "Frontend Next.js" as UI
component "Marketplace.Api" as API
component "Marketplace.BLL" as BLL
interface "Repositorios e integraciones\n(definidos en BLL)" as Ports
component "Marketplace.DAL" as DAL
component "Marketplace.Integrations\n(al incorporar IA e imágenes)" as INT
component "Marketplace.IoC" as IOC
component "DTOs / Models" as Shared
database "PostgreSQL/PostGIS" as DB
cloud "Proveedor IA / imágenes" as Ext
UI --> API : HTTP
API --> BLL
API --> IOC
BLL --> Ports
DAL ..|> Ports
INT ..|> Ports
IOC --> DAL
IOC --> INT
IOC --> BLL
BLL --> Shared
DAL --> Shared
DAL --> DB
INT --> Ext
note bottom of BLL
BLL depende de contratos propios, no de DAL.
Ranking determinista y ventas permanecen en BLL.
end note
@enduml

